 please draw my vtuber!!\n\nshe is an angel healer from an rpg. please draw her in a cute pose!! i like the way you draw big eyes.\n\ni like this kind of pose!! https://skeb.jp/@serurosu1226/works/4\n\ni want her to look beautiful and cool! i will use this for sns and twitch. thank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Vy-oB7b7oG3gCpUwGiao9SkHSIQROBDy?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@serurosu1226/works/26", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1885744, "client_id": 3223314, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/78d66e61/uploads/origins/ae4a2ddd-5f89-40e9-9c23-1d3e189d5799?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c74c922d4e3f077a20777eab3fa7a8b1", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/78d66e61/uploads/origins/ae4a2ddd-5f89-40e9-9c23-1d3e189d5799?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5162a7e38e2c0c533403563fb973d37a", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi! I love your artwork and I want to commission a birthday illustration for my original character. I want to use this picture as my wallpaper and profile picture for SNS.\n\nHere is the link for reference image. I hope you can draw the white dress suit. The elements on the dress are pink roses and musical notes.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1zF-roHOztrJ1K0iJysq-fjSsK4b1vkzw\n\nShe is a lop ear rabbit with brown fluffy ears end with pink. Her hair is ends with pink gradient. Her eyes are like melted ice cream.\n\nI hope you can draw cute expressions on her face and the overall tone to be sweet and lively. If possible,  I would like her to hold a birthday cake (preferably strawberry or chocolate flavor). Other content of the illustration depends on your own preferences.\n\nThank you for reading and I hope you can consider my commission!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1zF-roHOztrJ1K0iJysq-fjSsK4b1vkzw", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@serurosu1226/works/25", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1885744, "client_id": 2706198, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c8231e4/uploads/origins/d6c504ee-224b-43e6-ac9e-9f1f251f0fd1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=940fc1d93e4ab3244cf6a3e2b100c63e", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c8231e4/uploads/origins/d6c504ee-224b-43e6-ac9e-9f1f251f0fd1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a8a0cf1bfd38ad665729b6febce7f208", "src_set": ""}, "body": "せるろ〜す様\n\n兎彷魂あみゅと申します。\n先日は素敵なイラストありがとうございました！\nこの度、もう一度せるろ〜す様に私のイラストをご制作頂きたくリクエストさせて頂きました。  \n\n《依頼内容》 \n・キャラクター \n兎彷魂あみゅ \n\n・構図\n納品頂く季節にあったイラスト\nポーズや衣装等はおまかせでお願いします！\n \n・ファイル形式 \npsd\n可能でしたら背景レイヤーとキャラクターレイヤーを分けて頂けると助かります。\n\nご制作頂いたイラストはYouTubeサムネイルやTwitter等で使用させて頂く予定です。 \nサムネイル仕様のため頭の見切れていない引きのキャラクターのみのデータも頂けるととても助かります。\n\nそれでは何卒よろしくお願いします。\n\n 兎彷魂\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Xih4NxSubIsVPxhrJnd6de3fKOmELw9t", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@serurosu1226/works/24", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1885744, "client_id": 3008304, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a9b0fc1c/uploads/origins/3138627b-18e6-4812-8917-5848c04c1c04?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f59eb623f4ec628b27236d28a25a5894", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_t